        {
          "field": "evolved",
          "before": {
            "text": "Fanfare: Restore 2 defense to your leader.\n\nWard\nDuring your turn, whenever your leader's defense is restored, destroy a random enemy follower.\n\nSuper-Evolve: Replicate the effects of this card's Fanfare ability.",
            "rawSkillText": "<b><color=Keyword>Fanfare</color></b>: Restore 2 defense to your leader.\n<hr><b><color=Keyword>Ward</color></b>\nDuring your turn, whenever your leader's defense is restored, destroy a random enemy follower.\n<hr><sev><b><color=Keyword>Super-Evolve</color></b>: Replicate the effects of this card's <b><color=Keyword>Fanfare</color></b> ability.</sev>",
            "flavourText": "Ral knows where my loyalty lies. He must. But why then would he not listen to my words?\n...Ah, I see. From the very start, he never...\n—<i>Seraphic Gallows: Memories of an Enforcer</i>, Part 6",
